#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**SWAP gate**\n"
msgstr "**بوابة SWAP**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The SWAP gate swaps the states of two qubits.\n"
msgstr "تبادل بوابة SWAP حالتَي Qubitين.\n"

